                                "sense_id": "432f30bd-1de2-3a0c-ad4f-c1d429bc7ca7",
                                "text": "Thus for instance the paralysis may not extend to all the parts below the injury; it may be attended by severe pain in some of the semi-paralyzed parts; or , motion may be affected in one limb and sensibility in another."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "552e08ef-de5e-495d-a6e1-ef8db3b50fb2",
                                "sense_id": "432f30bd-1de2-3a0c-ad4f-c1d429bc7ca7",
                                "text": "Sometimes the face remains semi-paralyzed after the other signs of paralysis have disappeared."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ac600bd-374c-48c5-b54a-a5705a49ea97",
                                "sense_id": "432f30bd-1de2-3a0c-ad4f-c1d429bc7ca7",
                                "text": "If we put an end to regionalism and normalize the flow of great energies in the body of Kyrgyzstan, then there will be a very rapid healing of the whole country and people, who have been vegetating in a semi-paralyzed state for many decades due to the grave illness of tribalism and regionalism."
